gtL(){return"Remove from this workout"},
gtK(){return"Removes that block from the current session only. Saved history is not affected until you finish."},
gtJ(){return"Change exercise in history"},
gtI(){return"In a saved workout you can reassign a block to a different name. Only that session changes; charts follow the new name. Sets stay as they were."},
grK(){return"Interrupted workout"},
grJ(){return"If the app closes mid-session, it offers to continue where you left off or delete the unsaved draft."},
gu1(){return"Calendar"},
grP(){return"Add on a date"},
grO(){return"Pick a day, then add a workout at a chosen time. Useful for logging a missed session."},
guH(){return"I train others is for coaches. Add clients, schedule sessions, plan exercises ahead of time, and log workouts per person. Repeating the last session is optional. Export and import for coach data is separate from your personal history. Deleting a client removes future sessions but keeps past workouts for reporting."},
gt6(){return"Clients"},
gt5(){return"Add, edit, or delete clients. The list shows the last and next session. Profile fields: goal, weight, height, and private coach notes."},
gt4(){return"Client profile"},
gt3(){return"Start today's session from the profile: an empty live workout. Grey last-session numbers appear only after you pick an exercise. History lists completed workouts only. Plan future sessions on the calendar. Progress and favorites are on the same screen. When there is enough recent strength work, a rhythm gauge shows how often they train; tap it for a note about pace and rest. Unsaved profile edits ask before you leave."},
guJ(){return"Plan a session"},
guI(){return"Plan only from the coach calendar: pick a client and date, then name exercises. Previous weights and reps appear grey as a hint. A planned session shows a play icon. Tap it to start (today) or delete. Only finished workouts go to history. A plan whose date has already passed is removed."},
guL(){return"Repeat last workout"},
guK(){return"Optional. From the client profile, or as a switch when adding a session on the calendar. Copies the last session's exercises into today's live workout or a new plan; previous weights and reps show as grey hints, not as finished sets."},
